desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Ocamllint Marshal"
	title_zh: "Ocamllint Marshal"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-ocamllint-marshal"
	risk: "deserialization"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Marshaling is currently not type-safe and can lead to insecure behaviour when untrusted data is marshalled. Marshalling can lead to out-of-bound reads as well.

### 风险类型
不安全反序列化（deserialization）

### 影响
反序列化不可信数据可能触发任意代码执行或对象注入。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-502: Deserialization of Untrusted Data
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
避免反序列化不可信输入，使用安全的数据格式，并校验数据来源与类型。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.ml": <<<POS
input_value
POS
	"safefile://pos.ml": <<<NEG
Printf.printf
NEG
)

${*.ml}.pattern_regex(/(?:input_value)|(?:Marshal\.from_channel)|(?:Marshal\.from_bytes)|(?:Marshal\.from_string)/) as $p0
${*.mli}.pattern_regex(/(?:input_value)|(?:Marshal\.from_channel)|(?:Marshal\.from_bytes)|(?:Marshal\.from_string)/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Ocamllint Marshal",
	title_zh: "Ocamllint Marshal",
	message: "Ocamllint Marshal detected.",
}
